Revision history for Game-Fanorona

0.03    2026-10-13
        - Add options, the fields a launcher offers before a game
        - The keys, the screen, the steering and the typed line are Game::Terminal::Kit's
        - An unset NO_COLOR or an empty one leaves colour on; any other value turns it off
        - as_text writes a standing draw offer and a move half made, and from_text restores them and a resignation or agreement
        - u undoes and r redoes a turn, through Game::Terminal::Kit::History; up-right is 9 alone and the rules key is now R

0.02    2026-10-11
        - Add Game::Fanorona::Terminal->run(@argv), which returns the exit status

0.01    2026-10-11
        - First version.
